description:
My American Idiot sounding preset (I actually like it so much, it's become the basis of my main preset, with the tremolo swapped for a fuzz). Dialled in with a strat, so I use the heavy compression at the start to sound more like his Gibson with humbuckers, so turn off if you use a humbucker guitar. 7  snapshots.
1. Clean (City of the Damned, Dearly Beloved);
2. Crunch (Holiday intro);
3. Rhythm;
4. Lead;
5. Acoustic;
6. Radio AI (American Idiot intro);
